{"id":"d6a1ab60bf57b2aa","group":"92","path":"92/92-prop-lob-to-godel.md","title":"Gödel Unprovability from P1","display":"prop-lob-to-godel — Gödel Unprovability from P1","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-prop-lob-to-godel","aliases":["92-prop-lob-to-godel"],"display":"prop-lob-to-godel — Gödel Unprovability from P1","depends_on":["[[92-df-godel-sentence]]","[[92-df-consistent]]","[[92-lem-derivability-conditions]]"],"source":"第 IX 章 p. 108，Theorem 1（PDF 125）","source_status":"原书内容的本地重构"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-prop-lob-to-godel"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-prop-lob-to-godel</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-lob-to-godel — Gödel Unprovability from P1"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b823f18a7fc28400\" href=\"?note=b823f18a7fc28400\" title=\"92-df-godel-sentence\">92-df-godel-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5c268cc9a199d00a\" href=\"?note=5c268cc9a199d00a\" title=\"92-lem-derivability-conditions\">92-lem-derivability-conditions</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"第 IX 章 p. 108，Theorem 1（PDF 125）"},{"key":"source_status","html":"原书内容的本地重构"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G(\\gamma)\">\\(\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G(\\gamma)\\)</span> (Gödel-sentence predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b823f18a7fc28400\" href=\"?note=b823f18a7fc28400\" title=\"92-df-godel-sentence\">92-df-godel-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\)</span> (external consistency predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}lob\\text{-}to\\text{-}godel}\\vdash\n\\forall\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\land\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G(\\gamma)\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow G\\nvdash\\gamma\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}lob\\text{-}to\\text{-}godel}\\vdash\n\\forall\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\land\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G(\\gamma)\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow G\\nvdash\\gamma\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>P1 与一致性给出 Gödel 句不可证这一侧；其否定不可证另需假设</li>\n<li>证明：\n<ol>\n<li>固定点给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\vdash\\gamma\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner})\">\\(G\\vdash\\gamma\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner})\\)</span></li>\n<li>反设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\vdash\\gamma\">\\(G\\vdash\\gamma\\)</span>；固定点双条件给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\vdash\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner})\">\\(G\\vdash\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner})\\)</span></li>\n<li>由 P1 得 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\vdash\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner})\">\\(G\\vdash\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner})\\)</span>，而固定点亦给其否定，与一致性矛盾</li>\n</ol>\n</li>\n<li>因而在<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>相容时不能有<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\vdash\\gamma\">\\(G\\vdash\\gamma\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Source\">[Source]</h2>\n<p>Gödel 句的不可证侧由 P1 与一致性直接得出；无需将 Löb 用于不同句子的可证性前件。文件名作为历史标签保留，标题与证明使用正确的 P1 推导。</p>\n<p>原书定位：第 IX 章 p. 108，Theorem 1（PDF 125）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Source","text":"[Source]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-godel-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"b823f18a7fc28400","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-godel-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"c7befd96bd551ade","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-consistent]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-lem-derivability-conditions","status":"resolved","id":"5c268cc9a199d00a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-lem-derivability-conditions]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-godel-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"b823f18a7fc28400","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G(\\gamma)$ (Gödel-sentence predicate, see [[92-df-godel-sentence]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"c7befd96bd551ade","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Con}(G)$ (external consistency predicate, see [[92-df-consistent]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G(\\gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}lob\\text{-}to\\text{-}godel}\\vdash\n\\forall\\gamma\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\;\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\land\\mathrm{GdlSent}_G(\\gamma)\\bigr)\n\\Longrightarrow G\\nvdash\\gamma","display":true},{"tex":"G\\vdash\\gamma\\leftrightarrow\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"G\\vdash\\gamma","display":false},{"tex":"G\\vdash\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"G\\vdash\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\gamma\\urcorner})","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"G\\vdash\\gamma","display":false}],"bytes":1643,"backlinks":[{"id":"823a52c75bbad9bd","anchor":"ref-342","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[92-prop-lob-to-godel]]"}],"outgoing":["b823f18a7fc28400","c7befd96bd551ade","5c268cc9a199d00a"]}